From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: v0lumehi <aljic.zijad@googlemail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 13:33:54 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Decode BC textures on the CPU when the Metal device has no BC
 support

nvn_bcdec.c decodes BC1-7 into RGBA8 (R8/RG8, RGBA16F for BC6H) through bcdec.h; nvn_mtl.m creates the texture in that format
and fills it through the decoder. Profile key tex_bc_cpu.

Upstream-Status: fork-only (declined seedds/nxnative#488)
Reason: BC textures on GPUs without BC support (A15/A16 and older iPhones), outside upstream's supported devices; gated by supportsBCTextureCompression and the profile key tex_bc_cpu, so supported hardware is unchanged. Owned by us
Issue: LNPANDY/NX2Apple#123
